# T_SCRE: an item opened from the list, the LOC GET of its location's
# path answered "-ERR 404" (the session wants a password change): the
# message, then the form and the list left for the login, after which
# the next command, the location list, runs.  The new login armed the
# answer again for its third request, so the contents of a location,
# whose LOC GET of the title's path is that, get the same message and
# the screens are left for the login once more.
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
K ENTER
S LOCS
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG2
K ENTER
